    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play this pixelated style indie derby game! </h2><strong>destroy the cars that want to destroy you with you powerful gun and missiles in a battle arena.</strong><br><br><i>In this arcade style mini game you must survive and beat the record of seconds alive. </i><br><i>Face the aliens that put the giant worm in the land and get the diamons to get more strong cars ....<br>keep destroying them into pieces! feels good!</i><br><br>Avoid the chickens and loot the destroyed cars with Health Armor and Ammo!<br><br>Be carefull with the aliens! they drop a big worm on the arena, destroy it and get the green gems to unlock new cars!<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> High quality graphics with pixelated style made in Unreal Engine less than 2 gb<br></li><li> Shoot missiles and use your mini gun to destroy others cars<br></li><li> Cool sounds and music with an arcade style<br></li><li> Aliens will drop a big worm on the arena, destroy them and get the green gems to get other cars<br></li><li> Be carefull with the chicken-mine that will take your green gems<br></li><li> Nitro, Reset Car, Drifting, great explosions and more!<br></li><li> OBJETIVE: JUST STAY ALIVE!!!</li></ul><br>Enjoy this release from our studio LFR Games",
